ges.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10g7v.jpg"}, {"id": 1700636, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10g7w.jpg"}, {"id": 1700634, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10g7u.jpg"}], "slug": "heat-me-up", "storyline": "Flamy a heated iron ball stuck in the freezing cold world of Yetis where it needs fire orbs to survive. It gets dark and cold where Flamy's own light and heat can help itself.", "summary": "Feeling the chill? Heat things up with Heat Me Up!, the fiery arcade game where you control Flamy, a super-heated iron ball on a mission to stay hot! Guide Flamy by placing your finger on the screen \u2013 it's his personal launchpad! Tap below him to make him jump onto your finger, then skillfully slide your finger left or right to add momentum and direction, propelling him through the air. Collect blazing fire orbs to keep his temperature up, but watch out for those frosty yetis \u2013 they're not fans of Flamy's heat! Get ready for a scorching hot challenge that will keep you coming back for more. Download Heat Me Up! and turn up the heat!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/heat-me-up", "videos": [{"id": 168820, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "zE4mc3Kq5Ac", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zE4mc3Kq5Ac", "title": "Game Preview", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zE4mc3Kq5Ac/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}